{"overview":"The distant future: Humanity established the mobile fort city, Plantation, upon the ruined wasteland. Within the city were pilot quarters, Mistilteinn, otherwise known as the “Birdcage.” That is where the children live... Their only mission in life was the fight. Their enemies are the mysterious giant organisms known as Kyoryu. The children operate robots known as FRANXX in order to face these still unseen enemies. Among them was a boy who was once called a child prodigy: Code number 016, Hiro. One day, a mysterious girl called Zero Two appears in front of Hiro. “I’ve found you, my Darling.”","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":5,"y":2018,"poster":"/9ekil1DCsaMaE2aP0QUIuMuzNbI.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2018,"poster":"/eQG4HfuNCxF4ngPjGENv8zhflKw.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":["錦織敦史"],"crew_en":["Atsushi Nishigori"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"上村祐翔","role":"Hiro (voice)","photo":"/boQMSI9WA5x2LYDEsiq0udeKMNe.jpg","en":"Yuto Uemura"},{"name":"戸松遥","role":"Zero Two (voice)","photo":"/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","en":"Haruka Tomatsu"},{"name":"市ノ瀬加那","role":"Ichigo (voice)","photo":"/hBJx5tpLA2vkXqfkPZosGjW4e8C.jpg","en":"Kana Ichinose"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Gorou (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"نانامی یاماشیتا","role":"Miku (voice)","photo":"/m2AhWgQg1pwX10JcNizjNOluYRF.jpg","en":"Nanami Yamashita"},{"name":"سائوری هایامی","role":"Kokoro (voice)","photo":"/gLv9lO7dlUbIsmyJUvgegqAAXki.jpg","en":"Saori Hayami"},{"name":"井上麻里奈","role":"Nana (voice)","photo":"/f7PuEx1h2g4FLgMzk9wCrWuS9Eu.jpg","en":"Marina Inoue"},{"name":"石上静香","role":"Ikuno (voice)","photo":"/kXTYBI7skkVSjQ4eg49iEGblt3f.jpg","en":"Shizuka Ishigami"},{"name":"موتسومی تامورا","role":"Zorome (voice)","photo":"/uvbBIRiBK6GDLEESiYSFWOVlaE4.jpg","en":"Mutsumi Tamura"},{"name":"市川蒼","role":"Mitsuru (voice)","photo":"/tM1PwSZlOT23ia4PDKkGH